---
title: Text Redactor
description: Paste text and hide names, emails, phone numbers, addresses, card numbers and more. Runs in your browser with a local AI model. Nothing is uploaded.
---

<section class="tool-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <%= partial "partials/brand" %>
    <h1>Text Redactor</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Paste text and get a clean copy with personal data hidden.
      Detection runs on your device. Your text is never uploaded.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tool">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="model-bar" id="model" data-state="off">
      <div class="model-text">
        <strong>AI detection</strong>
        <span id="model-status">Pattern rules find emails, phones, cards and IDs. Turn on AI to also find names, organizations and places.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="model-actions">
        <select id="ai-lang" aria-label="Text language"></select>
        <button type="button" id="load" class="button">Turn on AI (29 MB)</button>
      </div>
      <div class="progress"><div id="progress-bar"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <div class="control">
        <span class="control-label">Hide</span>
        <div class="chips" id="categories"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="control-row">
        <label class="control">
          <span class="control-label">Replace with</span>
          <select id="style">
            <option value="labels">Labels: [NAME]</option>
            <option value="numbered">Numbered labels: [NAME_1]</option>
            <option value="blocks">Blocks: ████</option>
            <option value="redacted">[REDACTED]</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="control grow">
          <span class="control-label">Always hide these words</span>
          <input type="text" id="custom" placeholder="Project Falcon, Acme, Jane" autocomplete="off">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panes">
      <div class="pane">
        <div class="pane-head">
          <span>Original</span>
          <span class="pane-actions">
            <button type="button" id="example" class="text-button">Paste an example</button>
            <button type="button" id="clear" class="text-button">Clear</button>
          </span>
        </div>
        <textarea id="input" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Paste or type text here…" aria-label="Original text"></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="pane">
        <div class="pane-head">
          <span>Redacted</span>
          <span id="count" class="pane-meta"></span>
        </div>
        <div id="output" class="output is-empty" aria-live="polite" data-placeholder="The redacted text shows here. Click a redaction to keep the original."></div>
        <div class="pane-foot">
          <button type="button" id="copy" class="button">Copy</button>
          <button type="button" id="download" class="button button-outline">Download .txt</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notes">
      <div>
        <h3>Private by design</h3>
        <p>The page has no server code. The AI model, <a href="https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/bert-small-pii-detection-ONNX" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bert-small-pii-detection</a> (Apache-2.0), downloads once from Hugging Face, stays in your browser cache and runs on your device.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Check before you share</h3>
        <p>Automatic detection can miss things or hide too much. Read the result. Click a redaction to keep the original, or add words to always hide.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Good for AI prompts</h3>
        <p>Use numbered labels to remove personal data before you paste text into a chatbot. The same person always gets the same label.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="module" src="/javascripts/tools/text-redactor.js"></script>
